<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Countrywide buys Coles supermarkets.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Countrywide buys Coles supermarkets.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Countrywide Retail Management Ltd, the manager of Countrywide Retail Trust, said it would buy nine supermarkets from Coles Myer Ltd for a total of A$20.88 million.</p>
<p>Countrywide said the purchase would be completed on December 9, with the properties located in New South Wales, Queensland, Tasmania, South Australia, and Western Australia.</p>
<p>It said the purchase price represented a yield before acquisition costs of 10.3 percent with payment to be made in three instalments, ending on July 21 next year.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
